0012F3  2  F0 F9                BEQ     WRSER1a         ; NO, WAIT FOR IT
0012F5  2  68                   PLA
0012F6  2  8D 84 EF             STA     UART1DATA       ; WRITE DATA
0012F9  2  60                   RTS
